From a194d971fa2858925a74ffabcc3a71cf4a53a4c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Derek <derekgranito@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 19 Jun 2026 05:27:25 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(skills): add logs read-path skill for node devs
 (#46)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

* feat(skills): add logs read-path skill for node devs

Ships a developer-facing /logs skill so every wizard-born node knows the
read path for its own logs: the operator observability proxy endpoint,
how to get a developer grant, example LogQL queries, how to read the JSON,
and the own-node app-only scope limit (shared infra is operator-only).

* docs(skills): logs.md — node_id is its own field, not intent.name; use COGNI_API_KEY
