From 83f1bcfb202a096655fd2a5ab4548a4a9bbf868a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Derek <derekgranito@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 19 Jun 2026 13:18:36 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] =?UTF-8?q?feat(cognition):=20bring=20node-template=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?current=20with=20operator=20=E2=80=94=20mission=20+=20orientati?=
 =?UTF-8?q?on=20(#48)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

* feat(cognition): node identity from repo-spec — intent.name + mission heading (sync-port hub #1701)

Ports the node-identity surface from the operator hub (Cogni-DAO/cogni #1701)
that never reached node-template: forks inherited the cognition feature but not
the intent.mission heading, so every wizard-spawned node rendered the old
'Cogni `<uuid>` — Session Cognition' header with no mission.

- repo-spec schema: optional intent { name, mission } block
- accessors: extractNodeName (intent.name → node_id fallback) + extractNodeMission
- cognition contract: name + mission on the bundle response
- shared/config: getNodeName / getNodeMission
- cognition route + _bundle: render '<name> — Cogni Session Cognition' with a
  mission · skills · domains · loaded subtitle (matches the hub bundle)
- .cogni/repo-spec.yaml: a generic placeholder mission + forker guidance to
  replace it (the node's one-line identity, surfaced at session start)
- accessor unit coverage mirrored from the hub

Loader (scripts/agent/session-cognition.sh) intentionally NOT touched —
node-template's two-account variant already self-resolves the node URL.

* feat(cognition): orientation excerpt — port operator #1718 + #1735

Brings node-template's cognition bundle fully current with operator main:
the bundle now surfaces a bounded (<=480 char) current-node orientation
excerpt from the <slug>-agent-orientation knowledge entry (node-specific
wins over the inherited cogni-agent-orientation seed), with a 'seed one'
fallback when absent. Also adopts #1735's tightened invariants/recall text
and empty-domain suppression.

Files:
- app/.../cognition/_bundle.ts: OrientationExcerpt + excerptFromContent +
  render block + #1735 text (tabs, matching node-template style)
- app/.../cognition/route.ts: resolve <slug>-agent-orientation during the
  domain scan, fetch its excerpt via knowledgeStorePort.getKnowledge
- packages/knowledge-base/src/seeds/base.ts: cogni-agent-orientation seed

Now layered on the mission port already in this PR; merged current main (#49).
Skipped #1718's scaffold-gen/adapter hunks (node-formation, not bundle-read).
